00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:16.990
sposta semplicemente

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:17.530
la confusione

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:18.250
nella nuova posizione.

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:19.990
Lasciamo che Auto

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:20.610
unisca i pezzi

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:21.610
in un unico flusso quotidiano.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:22.550
Un nuovo lead

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.810
